{
 "about": "[O6b critic] cold: the title, begin, what the screen says; E into the car; W down Grand Ave into whatever is ahead (traffic, parked cars, the el's columns); what my car shows; out, look at it.",
 "url": "/?mute=1",
 "size": [1440, 900],
 "out": "shots/critic_o6b/cold",
